{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE4L1dpbnRlcnMlMjBEcmVhbSUyMCUyODIwMTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Winters Dream","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/5lyDeHVx7J6g0C4ubTIsNfGoAEV.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/30rUce9BUDzQDAwkFG7HZ1dU95l.jpg","description":"Former professional skier Kat works as a ski aid and ski shop worker at Bliss Mountain, where she prepares for a Winterfest to drum up business for the quaint town. Widowed father Ty and his daughter Anna come from New York to train with ski champion (and Kat’s former teammate) Maddy, and quickly connect with Kat when Maddy’s coaching style proves to be too aggressive for Anna. A spark forms between Kat and Ty as Kat coaches Anna and prepares for Winterfest with Ty. When a fall down the hill causes Anna to rethink the race and plan to go home early with Ty, though, Kat may lose both her new relationship and her rekindled confidence as a coach. Kat, Ty and Anna must all look deep within to conquer their fears and push forward.\n\nRated G · Released 27 Jan 2018 · Canada, United States of America · Language: English · 84 min\nStudio: Hallmark Media\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2018","genres":["Romance","TV Movie","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"84 min","cast":["Dean Cain","Kristy Swanson","Lucie Guest","Aren Buchholz","Lizzie Boys","Laura Bertram","Benjamin Wilkinson","Eric Keenleyside"],"director":["David Winning"],"released":"2018-01-27T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"David Winning","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/pQXcLaJ05OVmQuK5uM6Uqeuk1Ce.jpg"},{"name":"Dean Cain","character":"Ty","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vVBqgo0BJQVreLZaIW8tHI8hXYZ.jpg"},{"name":"Kristy Swanson","character":"Kat","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8gPVElKDCBllmfIP0pjZL9zISKv.jpg"},{"name":"Lucie Guest","character":"Maddy","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wwd9GV